  "synopsis": {
    "value": "Rock N Roll Sushi is a americanized sushi casual dining brand. Its ownership maps to Rock N Roll Sushi organization. Canonical pack: 71 units; 4 company-owned / 67 franchisee-owned. The canonical estate mixes company and franchise restaurants, so centralized standards must also work economically for franchise operators. For RBB, the CoS view is to identify the true technology decision center and prioritize solutions that make or save money, simplify restaurant work, or measurably improve the guest experience. POS/payments, digital ordering and loyalty, labor, throughput, reliability and restaurant-level ROI are the primary filters.",
